    "backstory": "Whispers follow Static Squawk from the rusted outskirts of Subchain City. Some say he was once a data runner, jacked into the old internet before the cataclysm, fried his brain on forbidden knowledge. Now, he seeks only the next jolt of DRIP, haunted by digital ghosts.",
